  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the Trust Fund is to co-finance the Ukraine
 Second Economic Recovery Development Policy Program which aims to: (i) fosterde-monopolization and anticorruption institutions; (ii) strengthen land and credit markets; and (iii) bolster the social safety.&quot;</narrative>
